Reproduction
  Keep ../testbooks/digital-small1.pdf locally (not part of the shared source).
  ./build.sh
  ./tests/run.sh
  python3 tests/verify.py
  Reference mutool can be built with ./tests/build-tools.sh and run as:
    ../mupdf-1.28.6-source/build/hostmusl-release/mutool draw -r 200 \
      -o shots/reference-mutool-%d.png ../testbooks/digital-small1.pdf 17,19
  Pillow is required for PNG previews. Zig 0.17.1 and MuPDF 1.28.6 are used.
